{"id":1010201,"chapter_id":1010201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"明信片内容：\n\n嗷呜找到家乡了！哼哼，你一个小场记在辛迪加没有本天才罩着，肯定不好过吧，肯定非常想念嗷呜和嗷呜的舞狮吧！\n等我哦，我有很重要的好消息要亲口告诉你！","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"字迹明显由成人代笔，明信片的背后附着一张相片，嗷呜在颇有民族风情的村落前意气风发地举着狮头，村头的牌匾上，写着金灿灿的三个字——金猊乡。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"你低头看了看手里相片上不可一世的舞狮人，又抬头看了看眼前正在打滚闹事、灰头土脸的小姑娘，叹了口气。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"这就是警报里说的……“有超危险级禁闭者当街闹事”？","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"看着不远处正在人群中胡闹的豆丁，你身后全副武装的警卫也有些尴尬地放下了手中的武器。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"这次一定不会有错！就是那个戴帽子的衰仔！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"人群中的嗷呜扫视着看热闹的百姓，指向一名幸运观众。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你看起来鬼鬼祟祟的！是不是你偷偷拿了我的狮头！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"混混","content":"你说谁是衰仔呢！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"好哇，居然敢顶嘴啊！肯定是做贼心虚！！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"嗷呜冲着混混所在的方向大吼一声，竟震出一层金色的声浪。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"好在混混眼疾手快闪过，但他身后不知谁家放在门口的水桶就遭了殃。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"混混","content":"你别乱咬人啊！都说了这里没有你的那个什么什么头！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"是狮头！那么大那么漂亮的狮头！怎么可能一点印象都没有！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"不听不听不听！骗人骗人骗人！撒谎要变成小狗的！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"她似乎又瞅准了街边二楼窗台上的花盆，一声怒吼将其震碎。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"就是在这里丢的！你们不告诉我，我就不走了！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"她叉着腰一屁股坐在地上。围观的街坊们也不敢靠近，生怕和她对上眼神，成为下一个被怀疑的倒霉对象。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"路人A","content":"她一直闹着要找的到底是个什么东西？很名贵的玩具吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"路人B","content":"管它是什么，我只知道这妮子砸坏了大伙不少东西。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"路人C","content":"也不知道是谁家孩子，忒不懂事！都说了没见过，非要挨家挨户闹……吵死了。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"路人D","content":"不是说已经有人报警了吗，那群在狄斯城吃公粮的废物怎么还不来逮她回去！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"咳咳……","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"作为“在狄斯城吃公粮的废物”的头头，你通过观察基本了解了此处的情况，穿过人群上前。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"options":["嗷呜，别闹了"],"style":6,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"嗷呜，别闹了","goto":26}]},{"step":26,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"哼哼，你们派谁来都不管用，不找到狮头，嗷呜今天是不会罢休的！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"乖乖把东西还给嗷呜，不然……咦？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"她看着眼前一步步靠近的那双千年不换的制服皮鞋，感觉有些熟悉。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你是——","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"她仰起头，终于看清了来者的模样。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"是小场记！！！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"嗷呜一把抱住你的大腿，像是抓住了救命稻草。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你身后那些是……跟着你一起来的好多场记！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"来得正好！我命令你们，现在、立刻、马上！让他们把狮头还给嗷呜！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"她死死攥紧你的裤脚，红着眼眶仰头看着你，等来的却是一句冰冷又无奈的答复。","style":3,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"滥用异能寻衅滋事。跟我们走一趟吧，禁闭者。","style":2,"background":1029,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"滥用异能？！寻衅滋事？！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1010204},{"step":38,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"区区场记，好大的胆子！怎么敢这样污蔑宇宙无敌超级第一的舞狮天才嗷呜呢？！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1010204},{"step":39,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"还不听我指挥！还不帮嗷呜找狮头！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1010204},{"step":40,"content":"刚刚还在路中央撒泼打滚的女孩此时正在审查椅上对着空气拳打脚踢。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1010204},{"step":41,"content":"你刚才在大街上，毫无章法地随意使用异能，怎么不算呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1010204},{"step":42,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"哼！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1010204},{"step":43,"content":"还是说……你其实根本就不知道禁闭者相关的规定条例？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1010204},{"step":44,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"不和不给嗷呜出头的冇胆鬼说话！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1010202},{"step":45,"content":"她鼓起腮帮子撇过头，对禁闭者的话题并无兴趣。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1010202},{"step":46,"content":"……那你的狮头确定是在辛迪加遗失的吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1010202},{"step":47,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"才不要回答你，反正你也不帮我找狮头，还把我带走关起来！略略略！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1010202},{"step":48,"content":"她吐吐舌头，赌气将头甩向另一个方向。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1010202},{"step":49,"content":"看来不将嗷呜哄好，无论哪个话题都无法推进。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1010202},{"step":50,"options":["回答我的问题才能帮你","把你带走就是在帮你"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"drawing":1010202,"choices":[{"text":"回答我的问题才能帮你","goto":54},{"text":"把你带走就是在帮你","goto":55}]},{"step":51,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗯？！几天不见，小场记怎么那么嚣张！居然还敢跟嗷呜提条件？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1010204,"next":[56]},{"step":52,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗯？！几天不见，小场记怎么那么嚣张！居然还敢跟嗷呜狡辩？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1010204,"next":[56]},{"step":53,"content":"……你看，你也知道我们有一段时间没有见面了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1010204},{"step":54,"content":"这些日子里，除了明信片上的信息，你的异能侵蚀情况，你的身体状况，我什么都不知道。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1010204},{"step":55,"content":"不知道你的状况，不知道你究竟去过哪里、经历过什么，那我要怎么帮你……帮天下第一舞狮天才美少女分析狮头的下落呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1010204},{"step":56,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗯……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1010202},{"step":57,"content":"这一套临时编造的说辞对于嗷呜而言还是有些过于冗长了，她沉思了很久才将信将疑地看向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1010201},{"step":58,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"好像……有一点点道理？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1010201},{"step":59,"content":"那天下第一舞狮天才美少女能不能告诉我，我不在你身边的时候，都发生了什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1010201},{"step":60,"content":"你是怎么回到家乡的，路上遇到了什么事情呢？为什么短短几个月时间，你的异能好像增值了不少？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1010201},{"step":61,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"找个狮头而已，要回答那么多吗？好麻烦！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1010202},{"step":62,"content":"这个嘛——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1010202},{"step":63,"content":"你看向手头还有一半空白的禁闭者档案，也有些无奈。“小场记”也有自己必须完成的工作。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1010202},{"step":64,"content":"所有问题都是为了还原狮头丢失前的经过。嗯，对，为了狮头。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1010202},{"step":65,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"唔……好吧，为了狮头！那嗷呜就从找回家乡开始讲起吧！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1010205},{"step":66,"content":"她一直赌气乱晃的手脚终于消停下来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1010205},{"step":67,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你知道的吧？我在送星仔回家的路上，遇到了很坏很坏的人！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1010205},{"step":68,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"然后嗷呜非常威风帅气地把他们都打倒了！获得了力量！成为了那个什么……那个……那个……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1010205},{"step":69,"options":["禁闭者？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"drawing":1010205,"choices":[{"text":"禁闭者？","goto":73}]},{"step":70,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"没错！就是这个名字！虽然有点难听……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1010205},{"step":71,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"等等……该不会是因为没有取名字，狮头生气了，才离家出走的吧！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1010205},{"step":72,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗷呜想着等自己认识更多的字了再取名，看来等不到那个时候了！要叫它什么好呢……狮狮？头头？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1010205},{"step":73,"content":"话题向着不可控制的方向发散着，你只能努力耐着性子引导。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1010205},{"step":74,"content":"你打倒了坏人，成为了禁闭者，然后呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1010205},{"step":75,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"然后？哦哦哦！然后啊，我利用这个能力，帮助了一个超级大的商队！他们看到嗷呜打败了坏蛋，都在夸赞嗷呜超级无敌宇宙霹雳第一厉害！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1010203},{"step":76,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"而且非常巧的是，那个商队，好像叫什么恩什么的，居然知道嗷呜的家乡！还有过来往！他们看到了嗷呜的狮头，拍着胸脯说一定是那儿的特产！就是金猊乡！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1010203},{"step":77,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"但你肯定没想到……袭击商队的坏家伙，竟然还留了一手！有几个很厉害的人来断后！然后！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1010203},{"step":78,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗷呜才不怕这些家伙呢！嗷呜掏出狮头！变成超级厉害的舞狮超人！然后咻咻咻咻——！金色的光和蓝色的光一起炸开！我……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1010203},{"step":79,"content":"等一下！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1010203},{"step":80,"content":"慷慨激昂的“咻咻咻”回荡在审查室里，还有那个蓝色的光，如果你没猜错，估计是来自星仔的能量。看来嗷呜的狂厄力量比以往更甚，可能是当时在灰烬使徒面前，得到了什么加护。\n叽叽喳喳的小女孩吵得你头疼，被突然打断的嗷呜也有些不满。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1010204},{"step":81,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"干嘛打岔？我正讲到最精彩的地方！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1010204},{"step":82,"content":"就是因为太精彩了，我想再了解一下这些“咻咻咻”的过程，这样我才能知道要怎么具体地夸你！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1010204},{"step":83,"content":"你丰富审查的经历所锻炼出的临场应变能力，对付嗷呜还是绰绰有余的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1010204},{"step":84,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"唔——其实这不是什么特别特别重要的细节，但既然你这样问了……好吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1010202},{"step":85,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我想你应该也很清楚，嗷呜作为舞狮这门功夫的唯一天选传承人，已经是很厉害很厉害的事了！但是……但是天才也总有做得不够好的地方。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1010202},{"step":86,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗷呜……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1010202},{"step":87,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"一直都躲在大家身后。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1010202},{"step":88,"content":"嗷呜的声音有些含糊，她低头看着自己由百家布拼成的裙摆，腰间的寄托着祝福的长命锁跟着她有些扭捏的小动作，发出窸窣铃响。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1010202},{"step":89,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"每次有坏事发生，嗷呜都是被挡在别人身后的那一个。无论是黛伦还是你手下的其他小小场记，大家都会站在嗷呜前面。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1010202},{"step":90,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"但在那次，面对坏蛋的，只有嗷呜和一群没有那个什么能力的人。","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1010202},{"step":91,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"虽然我也不认识他们，但他们才刚遭遇了坏事，又对嗷呜那么信任那么和蔼……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1010202},{"step":92,"content":"她少见地严肃起来，认真地看向你的眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1010201},{"step":93,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我也要做站在前面的那一个人！我也要像黛伦、像你、像你手下其他场记那样，站在前面！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1010201},{"step":94,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"有个词叫，什么什么一面？","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1010201},{"step":95,"content":"独当一面？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1010201},{"step":96,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"没错！我就是想学着大家独当一面的样子，然后嗷呜就觉得，自己体内的力量好像更强大了！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1010201},{"step":97,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"嗷呜可以保护好星仔！也就可以保护你们！可以保护流民寨的大家！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1010201},{"step":98,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我就是想要告诉你们这件事，所以才——！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1010201},{"step":99,"content":"她憋着一口气，有些委屈地涨红着脸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1010201},{"step":100,"content":"所以才回到辛迪加，对吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1010201},{"step":101,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":102,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":103,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":104,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":105,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":106,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":107,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":108,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":104,"course":6,"drawing":1010201},{"step":109,"content":"你要亲口告诉我的好消息，就是你也拥有了和禁闭者一样强大的力量，能够独当一面了，是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1010201},{"step":110,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我……嗷呜也不懂什么禁闭者，只是想风风光光地炫耀一下，哪知道……会发生这种事……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1010202},{"step":111,"content":"她突然泄了气，撅起能挂茶壶的嘴巴，撇开了视线。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1010202},{"step":112,"content":"发生了什么事？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1010202},{"step":113,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"就是，刚回到辛迪加，我就在那一片稍微歇了歇脚，那个……就，那样了……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1010202},{"step":114,"content":"就怎样？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1010202},{"step":115,"content":"平时咋咋呼呼的嗷呜难得露出难堪嗫喏的表情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1010202},{"step":116,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"就，我一个没注意，一回头，它，它就……","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1010202},{"step":117,"content":"狮头就不见了？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1010202},{"step":118,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"唔——都是你的错！我明明是要风风光光地回来的！现在连狮头都丢了！一点！都不！威风！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1010206},{"step":119,"content":"不是你自己搞丢的吗……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1010206},{"step":120,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我不管我不管！要不是你刚才不帮我，我现在都找到了！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1010206},{"step":121,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"都怪你非要拉我回来问这个问那个——啊，等一下！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1010206},{"step":122,"content":"她像是发现了什么令人震惊的大新闻。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1010206},{"step":123,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你、你问的这些问题和找狮头一点关系都没有啊！！！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1010206},{"step":124,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"呜哇——狮头，我的狮头——可能已经被小偷拿去红烧了——呜呜呜——","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1010206},{"step":125,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"呜呜呜我命令你！现在！马上！去找狮头！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1010206},{"step":126,"content":"说好的独当一面呢……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1010206},{"step":127,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"注意你和舞狮天才说话的态度！别忘了自己的身份！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1010206},{"step":128,"options":["配合嗷呜","尝试拒绝嗷呜"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201124,"trial_step":124,"course":3,"drawing":1010206,"choices":[{"text":"配合嗷呜","goto":125},{"text":"尝试拒绝嗷呜","goto":127}]},{"step":129,"content":"是是是，我是专门收拾烂摊子的小场记。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1010206},{"step":130,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"走，找狮头，出发！辛迪加！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1010205,"next":[129]},{"step":131,"content":"我还有很多工作要做……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1010206},{"step":132,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"没错，小场记的工作就是陪我找狮头！出发，辛迪加！","voice":["vo_trial_10201_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1010205,"next":[129]},{"step":133,"content":"她擤了擤鼻涕，不由分说地跳下审查椅，大摇大摆地走出门去。为了不让管理局陷入被河东狮吼吵翻天的经历，你也只好跟在她身后。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201129,"trial_step":129},{"step":134,"content":"这场小场记与舞狮明星的家家酒，似乎在找到狮头前还无法结束……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":110201130,"trial_step":130}]}